,"rows":[{"id":1,"slug":"clipsync","title":"ClipSync","subtitle":"局域网内的跨设备剪贴板同步","category_id":1,"summary":"不依赖云端的剪贴板同步工具，同一局域网内自动发现设备，支持文本、图片与文件路径。","body_md":"## 特点\n\n- 局域网直连，数据不出内网\n- 文本、图片、文件路径三类剪贴板内容\n- 支持 Windows / macOS / Linux 三端互传\n\n## 启动方式\n\n首次运行会在托盘区常驻，右键菜单可设置开机自启与监听端口。","cover_url":"https://cdn.example.com/covers/clipsync.png","status":"released","license":"MIT","version":"1.4.2","released_at":"2026-08-12","updated_at":"2026-10-20","sort_weight":100},{"id":2,"slug":"subtitle-forge","title":"SubtitleForge","subtitle":"批量字幕生成与对齐","category_id":1,"summary":"基于本地 whisper 模型的批量字幕生成工具，输出 srt 与 ass，支持按句对齐与时间轴微调。","body_md":"## 使用流程\n\n1. 拖入视频目录\n2. 选择模型规格（tiny / base / small / medium）\n3. 设置输出格式后开始任务\n\n任务队列支持断点续跑，中断后重新打开会从上次位置继续。","cover_url":"https://cdn.example.com/covers/subtitle-forge.png","status":"released","license":"MIT","version":"0.9.7","released_at":"2026-06-30","updated_at":"2026-09-18","sort_weight":90},{"id":3,"slug":"pocket-scan","title":"PocketScan","subtitle":"离线文档扫描","category_id":2,"summary":"完全离线的文档扫描与 OCR，不申请网络权限，导出 PDF 与图片。","body_md":"## 说明\n\n所有识别在设备本地完成，应用不包含网络请求代码。","cover_url":"https://cdn.example.com/covers/pocket-scan.png","status":"released","license":"Proprietary","version":"2.1.0","released_at":"2026-04-05","updated_at":"2026-07-22","sort_weight":80},{"id":4,"slug":"tmux-cheatsheet","title":"Tmux 速查卡","subtitle":"键盘操作与配置片段","category_id":1,"summary":"常用 tmux 快捷键与配置文件片段，按场景分类整理。","body_md":"## 配置文件片段\n\n将片段追加到 `~/.tmux.conf` 后执行 `tmux source-file ~/.tmux.conf` 生效。","cover_url":null,"status":"released","license":"CC-BY-4.0","version":"1.0.0","released_at":"2025-11-02","updated_at":"2026-02-14","sort_weight":60}]},"work_tags":{"columns":["work_id","tag_id"],"rows":[{"work_id":1,"tag_id":1},{"work_id":2,"tag_id":1},{"work_id":1,"tag_id":2},{"work_id":4,"tag_id":2},{"work_id":1,"tag_id":3},{"work_id":4,"tag_id":3},{"work_id":3,"tag_id":4},{"work_id":1,"tag_id":5},{"work_id":2,"tag_id":6}]},"work_assets":{"columns":["id","work_id",